---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  description={`Disclaimer for ${SITE.name} — the nature and limitations of the content on this site.`}
  lede="What this site is, what it is not, and the limits of the advice it contains."
  updated="June 2025"
>
  <p>
    The information published on {SITE.name} is intended for general home decorating inspiration
    and guidance only. It does not constitute professional interior design, structural, electrical,
    plumbing or legal advice.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site should be treated as a substitute for qualified professional advice. Before
    undertaking any structural work, electrical installation, plumbing or significant renovation,
    consult a licensed professional in your area. Local building codes, regulations and safety
    requirements vary and are your responsibility to verify.
  </p>

  <h2>DIY and home improvement projects</h2>
  <p>
    DIY guides on this site are written to be helpful and accurate, but results will vary depending
    on your skill level, tools, materials and the specific conditions of your home. {SITE.name}
    accepts no responsibility for any injury, damage or loss arising from following instructions
    published on this site. Always follow manufacturer instructions and relevant safety guidelines.
  </p>

  <h2>Product recommendations</h2>
  <p>
    Products mentioned or linked on this site are included for illustrative purposes or because we
    believe they represent good value. We cannot guarantee their quality, safety, availability or
    suitability for your specific situation. Always read product specifications and reviews before
    purchasing. See our <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure policy</a> for information about affiliate
    relationships.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy and completeness</h2>
  <p>
    We make reasonable efforts to ensure the information on this site is accurate at the time of
    publication. However, we make no warranties or representations about the accuracy, reliability
    or completeness of any content. Information may become outdated and we are not obligated to
    update it. Prices, product availability and specifications change frequently.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} and its contributors shall not be liable
    for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential or punitive damages arising from your use
    of this site or reliance on its content. Your use of this site is entirely at your own risk.
  </p>

  <h2>External websites</h2>
  <p>
    Links to third-party websites are provided for convenience. We have no control over those sites
    and are not responsible for their content, accuracy or practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions about this disclaimer, please use the form on our
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
